WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.960
<b>Year 2 Class 3</b>

00:03.170 --> 00:04.830
<b>Workplace visits...</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:10.460
<b>Workplace</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:10.460
<b>Visits</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:10.460
<b>Fast Food</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:10.460
<b>Commercial</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:10.460
<b>Store</b>

00:05.010 --> 00:10.460
<b>Bakery</b>

00:05.010 --> 00:10.460
<b>Publishing</b>

00:05.010 --> 00:10.460
<b>Company</b>

00:05.010 --> 00:10.460
<b>Nagasaki Hut</b>

00:05.010 --> 00:10.460
<b>Convenience</b>

00:05.290 --> 00:07.460
<b>A miserable event where we get split into groups,</b>

00:07.460 --> 00:08.830
<b>sent to some company,</b>

00:08.830 --> 00:10.290
<b>and have to write up a report on it all.</b>

00:10.670 --> 00:12.460
<b>The workplaces I really want to visit are...</b>

00:12.540 --> 00:14.080
<b>Crime investigation sites.</b>

00:14.080 --> 00:15.290
<b>Medical coroners.</b>

00:15.290 --> 00:16.880
<b>Or drug cartels or something.</b>

00:17.000 --> 00:20.170
<b>The sort of work that offers a glimpse at
the darkest corners of our society.</b>

00:20.630 --> 00:24.040
<b>Form up into groups of six with similar interests.</b>

00:24.040 --> 00:25.460
<b>Okay.</b>

00:25.460 --> 00:29.170
<b>Unfortunately, there's an even
bigger problem at hand here.</b>

00:34.130 --> 00:36.710
<b>I want to go to Nagasaki Hut.</b>

00:36.710 --> 00:38.920
<b>Great, sure, but we're drawing lots.</b>

02:12.580 --> 02:13.880
<b>Good grief...</b>

02:13.880 --> 02:16.920
<b>Groups of six "with similar interests"? Seriously?</b>

02:17.290 --> 02:18.540
<b>Ichikawa.</b>

02:19.170 --> 02:20.580
<b>I'll let you in with us.</b>

02:20.580 --> 02:23.710
<b>Oh, yeah, thanks...</b>

02:23.960 --> 02:26.420
<b>So be it, I'll help them fill their group.</b>

02:26.420 --> 02:30.210
<b>Won't be hard to stay out of sight in a group like theirs.</b>

02:30.330 --> 02:31.210
<b>Yo, look!</b>

02:31.210 --> 02:34.630
<b>Yamada only has a group of four,
so they need two more!</b>

02:34.750 --> 02:38.420
<b>Hara's group only has four too,
so they need another two.</b>

02:41.040 --> 02:43.250
<b>Wanna split up, then?</b>

02:43.250 --> 02:44.630
<b>Not like we have much choice!</b>

02:44.630 --> 02:45.210
<b>What?!</b>

02:46.250 --> 02:47.040
<b>Hey, wait-</b>

02:47.040 --> 02:49.830
<b>Hey! Mind adding me and Ota here to the group?</b>

02:51.040 --> 02:52.830
<b>Hang on now!</b>

02:52.830 --> 02:55.790
<b>If we're taking anyone it would
definitely be those other two.</b>

02:56.290 --> 02:58.420
<b>S-Sekine...</b>

02:58.580 --> 02:59.420
<b>Right?</b>

02:59.420 --> 03:01.830
<b>I don't care who we take, so long as it's not Adachi.</b>

03:01.830 --> 03:02.460
<b>Wha...</b>

03:02.540 --> 03:03.830
<b>Or what?</b>

03:03.830 --> 03:06.460
<b>Did you want to join us yourself or something?</b>

03:06.460 --> 03:11.380
<b>N-nope!
It's just Kanzaki here was thinking of joining Hara.</b>

03:11.460 --> 03:13.420
<b>You id-Shh!</b>

03:13.420 --> 03:16.170
<b>It's not really a secret to me or Yamada anymore.</b>

03:19.290 --> 03:24.040
<b>Okay, how about we hold our own
little draft to pick from the four of you?</b>

03:24.130 --> 03:25.170
<b>What?!</b>

03:25.170 --> 03:27.880
<b>Why should you get to decide for us?</b>

03:27.880 --> 03:29.290
<b>Way to be a bitch.</b>

03:30.500 --> 03:33.080
<b>Is that really the way you ought to be speaking to me?</b>

03:34.920 --> 03:36.000
<b>Sowwy...</b>

03:36.000 --> 03:38.580
<b>How bad does he want to be in this group?</b>

03:38.790 --> 03:40.580
<b>Just hang on a minute, then.</b>

03:42.420 --> 03:44.170
<b>Let's just go majority rules, yeah?</b>

03:44.170 --> 03:45.710
<b>Who wants Adachi?</b>

03:46.500 --> 03:47.460
<b>Yup, that's a big zero.</b>

03:47.460 --> 03:49.130
<b>Hang on now! Zero...?</b>

03:49.210 --> 03:52.080
<b>Agh! There's no way I'm getting picked.</b>

03:52.290 --> 03:54.540
<b>Okay, next is Ota.</b>

03:54.710 --> 03:58.630
<b>Wait, should we talk this out before we vote?</b>

03:58.830 --> 04:00.580
<b>Who do you want?</b>

04:01.040 --> 04:03.290
<b>It's not that I want anyone in particular.</b>

04:03.420 --> 04:04.830
<b>Pretty normal, I'd say.</b>

04:04.830 --> 04:05.830
<b>Yeah?</b>

04:06.500 --> 04:10.170
<b>How normal is your "normal," though?</b>

04:10.170 --> 04:12.080
<b>I see...</b>

04:12.080 --> 04:13.790
<b>Okay, let's go with that, then.</b>

04:13.790 --> 04:15.250
<b>Fine by me.</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.830
<b>Okay! We've made our decision!</b>

04:17.830 --> 04:19.790
<b>First pick of the draft is-</b>

04:22.040 --> 04:26.080
<b>Kanzaki! Picked by three out of four of us!</b>

04:26.670 --> 04:29.920
<b>Why's this super perv so popular?!</b>

04:29.920 --> 04:31.750
<b>Oh, but I...</b>

04:33.330 --> 04:35.750
<b>W-wait! Hang on a second!</b>

04:35.960 --> 04:38.540
<b>Why? You object or something?</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:43.630
<b>No, no, I just thought we should ask him first. Right?</b>

04:43.630 --> 04:46.170
<b>O-oh, I just...</b>

04:46.420 --> 04:50.540
<b>There's no way he can turn them down like this.</b>

04:52.460 --> 04:56.500
<b>T-this just means the offer's there,
not that you have to join.</b>

04:57.500 --> 05:00.290
<b>You study hard and have good grades, right?</b>

05:00.830 --> 05:02.500
<b>I mean, they're not bad.</b>

05:02.500 --> 05:05.830
<b>You'd probably be better off in
that group over there, then.</b>

05:05.830 --> 05:07.170
<b>Ichikawa...</b>

05:07.420 --> 05:10.830
<b>This isn't some game, this is a learning event.</b>

05:10.830 --> 05:14.080
<b>He'd surely be better off with
people with the same level of intel-</b>

05:14.750 --> 05:15.460
<b>Whoops...</b>

05:15.580 --> 05:17.880
<b>G-good point!</b>

05:17.880 --> 05:20.880
<b>Guess this group is my only hope since
I'm a big ol' dummy!</b>

05:21.000 --> 05:22.330
<b>Yeah, me too.</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:23.170
<b>Shoot, no!</b>

05:23.250 --> 05:25.790
<b>I got a 40 last time in science!</b>

05:27.250 --> 05:29.040
<b>And that matters how?</b>

05:29.040 --> 05:30.670
<b>Damn, he's dumber than me.</b>

05:30.670 --> 05:32.210
<b>A real earnest idiot, huh?</b>

05:32.290 --> 05:36.670
<b>Okay, I guess me and Ichikawa will join and
round out our team of dummies, then!</b>

05:37.170 --> 05:41.040
<b>Who said we're dumb? I'm fifth in our year!</b>

05:42.130 --> 05:44.630
<b>Okay, we'll just go join the other team, then.</b>

05:44.630 --> 05:45.500
<b>Right...</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:48.170
<b>Okay class, all grouped up, yet?</b>

05:48.170 --> 05:51.580
<b>Feels like all that did more harm than good...</b>

05:54.460 --> 05:55.710
<b>That was all just a lie, wasn't it?</b>

06:00.630 --> 06:01.830
<b>How...?</b>

06:01.920 --> 06:04.880
<b>Quiz: Chemical Reactions</b>

06:01.920 --> 06:04.880
<b>Kyotaro Ichikawa          Science</b>

06:02.210 --> 06:04.130
<b>How did she know?</b>

06:04.920 --> 06:06.420
<b>World Dogs Book</b>

06:08.830 --> 06:14.130
<b>Did Yamada realize I wanted to be in the same group?</b>

06:16.040 --> 06:17.330
<b>She couldn't have!</b>

06:17.330 --> 06:20.830
<b>I wasn't trying to join them, anyway.</b>

06:20.830 --> 06:26.790
<b>All I wanted to do was help Kanzaki join Hara's group...</b>

06:30.960 --> 06:33.500
<b>What's going on with those two, anyway?</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:36.540
<b>Oh, Hara!</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:39.830
<b>Potato Chips</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:39.830
<b>Triple Potato</b>

06:37.880 --> 06:39.630
<b>Quit being so obvious!</b>

06:39.920 --> 06:42.170
<b>Oh! Triple Potato flavor!</b>

06:42.380 --> 06:43.630
<b>That worked...?</b>

06:44.540 --> 06:48.250
<b>I'm still on a diet, though.</b>

06:48.250 --> 06:49.880
<b>Why'd you come over, then?</b>

06:49.880 --> 06:53.170
<b>I was just hoping to talk with you.</b>

06:53.460 --> 06:56.500
<b>Really?! Hooray! You picked me over snacks!</b>

06:56.670 --> 06:59.960
<b>Seconds in and we're already verging
on moe manga territory, here.</b>

07:00.210 --> 07:04.290
<b>Didn't Kanzaki say he liked curvy girls, though?</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:05.920
<b>You can't fall for that!</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:10.920
<b>That's only for girls who are pretty to begin with.</b>

07:11.080 --> 07:13.420
<b>Got to lose weight if I want any hope.</b>

07:13.630 --> 07:16.500
<b>Why? You're a cutie.</b>

07:16.500 --> 07:17.920
<b>No I'm not...</b>

07:18.460 --> 07:20.960
<b>How are things going with him, though?</b>

07:21.210 --> 07:22.250
<b>Well, actually...</b>

07:22.250 --> 07:24.250
<b>Trying to help her keep it secret, huh?
</b><b>Well, actually...</b><b></b>

07:24.460 --> 07:26.830
<b>The two of you went out together?!</b>

07:26.830 --> 07:27.880
<b>And now it was all for nothing!</b>

07:28.250 --> 07:30.000
<b>Keep your voice down!</b>

07:30.000 --> 07:31.330
<b>Ah! Sorry!</b>

07:31.330 --> 07:33.290
<b>We only went out shopping.</b>

07:33.380 --> 07:35.880
<b>That perv's making progress?!</b>

07:36.040 --> 07:37.710
<b>How far did you go?</b>

07:37.710 --> 07:39.750
<b>Y-you mean, like....</b>

07:40.250 --> 07:41.290
<b>Out to Shibuya?</b>

07:41.290 --> 07:43.880
<b>Huh? Oh. Just Koyama.</b>

07:43.880 --> 07:44.830
<b>What did you think she meant?!</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:46.880
<b>Yeah?</b>

07:46.880 --> 07:50.580
<b>That's great.
I've always wanted to talk about this stuff.</b>

07:50.580 --> 07:53.040
<b>Chii doesn't care for this sort of stuff.</b>

07:53.170 --> 07:57.170
<b>I'd love to hear your stories, too!</b>

07:57.170 --> 07:59.290
<b>Bet you have lots more to talk about than I do.</b>

08:00.420 --> 08:03.790
<b>This is definitely bordering on stuff
I shouldn't be here for...</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:05.000
<b>Like boyfriends?</b>

08:05.630 --> 08:06.580
<b>I don't have one.</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:11.790
<b>You've had one before though, right?</b>

08:11.790 --> 08:12.830
<b>Nope.</b>

08:15.330 --> 08:22.080
<b>Sorry, I just assumed you'd be
dating someone charming.</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:25.710
<b>I don't need one to be able to offer advice though, okay?</b>

08:25.710 --> 08:27.750
<b>Quit being so obviously peeved!</b>

08:27.830 --> 08:29.540
<b>You ever imagine what it's like?</b>

08:29.540 --> 08:31.330
<b>I sure do!</b>

08:31.330 --> 08:33.080
<b>She's really going deep, huh?</b>

08:33.380 --> 08:36.540
<b>Is there anything you want to
do once you have a boyfriend?</b>

08:36.630 --> 08:39.210
<b>W-what do you mean by "do"?</b>

08:39.210 --> 08:40.290
<b>Hara, chill!</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:42.040
<b>This is what I want to do!</b>

08:44.960 --> 08:46.960
<b>Share a pair of ear buds.</b>

08:46.960 --> 08:49.580
<b>Oh, THAT sort of thing...</b>

08:49.580 --> 08:50.880
<b>Let's take a selfie!</b>

08:51.500 --> 08:53.000
<b>Say cheese!</b>

08:55.040 --> 08:58.040
<b>Sorry, I was trying to make our
faces look the same size...</b>

08:58.040 --> 08:59.830
<b>Girls are always doing that!</b>

09:00.000 --> 09:00.880
<b>Then there's this!</b>

09:01.460 --> 09:03.670
<b>Holding hands inside my pocket.</b>

09:03.670 --> 09:05.500
<b>Oh, good idea.</b>

09:07.460 --> 09:08.710
<b>What a slob!</b>

09:09.250 --> 09:10.830
<b>Let's use your pocket.</b>

09:15.130 --> 09:16.330
<b>Pie Choco!</b>

09:16.460 --> 09:20.460
<b>I-I was planning on giving that to you, y'know...</b>

09:21.580 --> 09:23.580
<b>You should have it.</b>

09:25.750 --> 09:27.460
<b>Maybe just this once.</b>

09:29.630 --> 09:30.960
<b>It's so good!</b>

09:30.960 --> 09:31.880
<b>Glad to hear it!</b>

09:32.250 --> 09:34.960
<b>If only this could last forever.</b>

09:37.330 --> 09:38.380
<b>What is it?</b>

09:38.500 --> 09:39.670
<b>Is that a ghost?!</b>

09:40.040 --> 09:42.830
<b>No, but I think I know...</b>

09:43.830 --> 09:46.880
<b>Oh, it was you.</b>

09:47.330 --> 09:49.960
<b>I guess it's fine if he heard all that, then.</b>

09:49.960 --> 09:51.830
<b>Doubt anyone would hear about it from him.</b>

09:52.330 --> 09:54.130
<b>Was that a dig at me?</b>

09:54.500 --> 09:57.040
<b>Are the two of you always in here together?</b>

09:57.040 --> 09:59.130
<b>Whenever I don't have work, yeah.</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:00.250
<b>Really?</b>

10:00.380 --> 10:04.290
<b>Wha? No, I've always come here everyday...</b>

10:04.290 --> 10:07.330
<b>Yamada just started showing up one day.</b>

10:07.330 --> 10:09.080
<b>And now we just, you know...</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:11.000
<b>Hmm?</b>

10:13.080 --> 10:15.040
<b>Let me know if you make any progress!</b>

10:15.040 --> 10:16.380
<b>Same to you!</b>

10:17.670 --> 10:20.540
<b>She doesn't have a boyfriend.
Never has, either.</b>

10:21.000 --> 10:22.790
<b>But, so what?</b>

10:23.130 --> 10:25.130
<b>That's got nothing to do with me...</b>

10:28.920 --> 10:32.170
<b>Maybe something really is wrong with me.</b>

10:34.500 --> 10:35.580
<b>It's raining?</b>

10:39.420 --> 10:43.420
<b>A storm rolls in out of nowhere,
people share umbrellas, bump shoulders.</b>

10:43.420 --> 10:46.380
<b>The sort of situation that more social sorts
get lots out of when they forget their umbrellas.</b>

10:56.580 --> 10:59.330
<b>Oh, right, you ride your bike in.</b>

10:59.790 --> 11:01.580
<b>What's that got to do with anything?</b>

11:03.250 --> 11:07.380
<b>Wait, would she have asked to
share an umbrella if I had one?</b>

11:10.080 --> 11:11.210
<b>That looks kind of big on you.</b>

11:11.670 --> 11:14.080
<b>Hey, I know! You should let me wear it!</b>

11:14.080 --> 11:15.250
<b>Wait, but I-</b>

11:15.710 --> 11:19.710
<b>I'll borrow it and go buy an umbrella
from the convenience store.</b>

11:20.330 --> 11:21.750
<b>I can just go do that.</b>

11:21.750 --> 11:23.580
<b>That'd be a bit much to ask.</b>

11:23.580 --> 11:25.080
<b>Hurry up and take it off!</b>

11:28.460 --> 11:30.380
<b>Yup! Just my size!</b>

11:30.380 --> 11:32.830
<b>She's wearing my raincoat...</b>

11:33.210 --> 11:34.790
<b>I'll be right back!</b>

11:35.380 --> 11:37.790
<b>I WILL come back, I promise!</b>

11:37.790 --> 11:39.710
<b>I wasn't afraid you wouldn't.</b>

11:40.250 --> 11:42.290
<b>If this were an anime,
that'd probably be my last line.</b>

11:42.290 --> 11:43.670
<b>Just go already.</b>

11:45.920 --> 11:48.500
<b>Hearing her say that does make
me kind of worried, though...</b>

11:50.000 --> 11:51.330
<b>Is that her bag?</b>

11:51.960 --> 11:53.580
<b>Is her wallet in here?</b>

11:53.580 --> 11:56.710
<b>But I mean, even if it is, she has her charge card, right?</b>

11:58.040 --> 11:59.420
<b>Guess not!</b>

12:05.210 --> 12:06.710
<b>H-hey!</b>

12:06.960 --> 12:08.210
<b>Hey!</b>

12:09.210 --> 12:10.880
<b>Ya...mada!</b>

12:13.000 --> 12:14.960
<b>Your bag! Your wallet!</b>

12:18.540 --> 12:20.670
<b>I was just trying to keep it dry.</b>

12:24.540 --> 12:26.750
<b>This is so you don't get wet.</b>

12:28.080 --> 12:30.330
<b>My wallet's in the top pouch.</b>

12:30.330 --> 12:32.330
<b>Can you take it out and put it in my pocket?</b>

12:32.330 --> 12:33.170
<b>Wha...?</b>

12:42.080 --> 12:44.960
<b>That's broken...</b>

12:49.670 --> 12:50.420
<b>This?</b>

12:50.420 --> 12:50.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:52.500 --> 12:55.040
<b>No! Not there! It'll get wet!</b>

12:55.670 --> 12:57.540
<b>Put it in my shirt pocket.</b>

12:57.540 --> 12:58.420
<b>What...?</b>

13:12.420 --> 13:14.330
<b>T-thanks...</b>

13:14.330 --> 13:16.830
<b>You should run on back, now.</b>

13:17.750 --> 13:19.000
<b>You hurry, too.</b>

13:27.290 --> 13:33.210
<b>Did she just not want to admit her mistake?</b>

13:33.750 --> 13:35.880
<b>Or was she hoping to share an umbrella?</b>

13:38.540 --> 13:39.580
<b>I'm back!</b>

13:40.080 --> 13:43.210
<b>Okay, maybe she just wanted to go buy snacks.</b>

13:46.380 --> 13:48.580
<b>Do you like mint chocolate?</b>

13:48.880 --> 13:49.960
<b>Don't really care either way.</b>

13:50.130 --> 13:54.790
<b>Wait, but almost everyone either loves it or hates it, right?</b>

13:54.960 --> 13:56.170
<b>Do they?</b>

13:57.290 --> 13:58.630
<b>She bought Pie Choco.</b>

13:58.880 --> 14:00.830
<b>Guess she really wanted it after all.</b>

14:01.830 --> 14:04.000
<b>Do you think I love it or hate it?</b>

14:04.130 --> 14:06.500
<b>The answer's out of the wrapper already!</b>

14:06.790 --> 14:07.710
<b>Time's up!</b>

14:07.710 --> 14:08.830
<b>That was fast!</b>

14:08.830 --> 14:11.170
<b>It was a test of your reaction time.</b>

14:11.460 --> 14:13.080
<b>Shoulda said so first.</b>

14:13.080 --> 14:13.750
<b>Bye, then.</b>

14:15.210 --> 14:16.920
<b>Here you go, a participation prize.</b>

14:16.920 --> 14:17.920
<b>Ice cream?</b>

14:18.710 --> 14:19.880
<b>Want something else?</b>

14:24.500 --> 14:26.210
<b>Yup, no doubt about it.</b>

14:26.210 --> 14:29.080
<b>There's definitely something wrong with me.</b>

14:31.380 --> 14:33.830
<b>I like her.</b>

14:35.830 --> 14:37.710
<b>Thanks...</b>

14:41.880 --> 14:43.250
<b>Ichikawa!</b>

14:45.170 --> 14:46.880
<b>I never told you the answer!</b>

14:48.290 --> 14:49.630
<b>I'm practically in love!</b>

14:53.790 --> 14:56.710
<b>W-with mint chocolate, yeah?!</b>

14:57.330 --> 14:59.750
<b>ONLY with mint chocolate!</b>

15:00.880 --> 15:03.920
<b>I'd never shouted that loud in my entire life.</b>

15:07.290 --> 15:10.000
<b>It's finally time for our workplace visit.</b>

15:10.290 --> 15:11.880
<b>Oh! I want some Fair-chiki!</b>

15:11.880 --> 15:12.790
<b>Too bad!</b>

15:12.880 --> 15:13.380
<b>I might have wound up in Yamada's group,</b>

15:13.380 --> 15:14.500
<b>On the way home, then?
</b><b>I might have wound up in Yamada's group,</b><b></b>

